<p>1. Bh2 Bxh2 2. g3 Bxg3 3. Rf4 Bxf4 4. d6 Bxd6 5. Qh2! Bxh2 6. Re5 Bxe5 7. Nb5 Bf4 8. f6 (the only legal alternative to moving the needed b5 knight) 9. Bxc7+ Nxc4 and the game is drawn by stalemate!</p>
